WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.666
The elephant and the raptor stared at the lion.

2
00:00:04.667 --> 00:00:09.027
[g@"Sun Wukong is alive inside you," said the raptor.

3
00:00:09.028 --> 00:00:16.623
"Aren't you worried?"@g]

4
00:00:16.624 --> 00:00:18.874
[g@The lion sat down on his throne.

5
00:00:18.875 --> 00:00:21.151
"Worried about what?"@g]

6
00:00:21.152 --> 00:00:23.545
"Well," said the raptor.

7
00:00:23.546 --> 00:00:26.728
[g@"The monkey is talking inside you.

8
00:00:26.729 --> 00:00:29.455
Doesn't that bother you?"@g]

9
00:00:29.456 --> 00:00:33.009
[g@"Let him talk," said the lion defiantly.

10
00:00:33.010 --> 00:00:35.913
"It doesn't bother me at all."@g]

11
00:00:35.914 --> 00:00:39.098
[g@"What shall I talk about?" Wukong called.

12
00:00:39.099 --> 00:00:41.422
"Who wants to hear a story?"@g]

13
00:00:41.423 --> 00:00:44.333
The elephant shook his head slowly.

14
00:00:44.334 --> 00:00:47.794
[g@"What if the monkey never stops talking?

15
00:00:47.795 --> 00:00:50.996
You'll never get any sleep."@g]

16
00:00:50.997 --> 00:00:55.690
[g@"Hmm," said the lion. "That would be bad."

17
00:00:55.691 --> 00:00:58.071
He thought for a moment.@g]

18
00:00:58.072 --> 00:00:59.433
[g@"I know what to do.

19
00:00:59.434 --> 00:01:02.678
I'll stop eating."@g]

20
00:01:02.679 --> 00:01:06.301
"What will that do?" asked the elephant.

21
00:01:06.302 --> 00:01:10.659
"Yes," said Wukong. "What will that do?"

22
00:01:10.660 --> 00:01:15.754
[g@"If I don't eat, Wukong doesn't eat," said the lion.

23
00:01:15.755 --> 00:01:18.814
"I'll make him starve."@g]

24
00:01:18.815 --> 00:01:21.878
[g@Wukong laughed.

25
00:01:21.879 --> 00:01:23.427
"Nice try, lion!@g]

26
00:01:23.428 --> 00:01:26.918
But I'll just turn one of my hairs into a stove.

27
00:01:26.919 --> 00:01:31.003
I'll cook a nice meal in here!"

28
00:01:31.004 --> 00:01:34.324
"Oh dear." The raptor shook his head.

29
00:01:34.325 --> 00:01:40.003
"If that monkey fires up a stove, it will make you very hot.

30
00:01:40.004 --> 00:01:42.871
Plus it will create lots of smoke.

31
00:01:42.872 --> 00:01:50.016
The smoke will fill your head, and you'll never stop sneezing!"

32
00:01:50.017 --> 00:01:53.630
At last the lion was starting to look nervous.

33
00:01:53.631 --> 00:01:56.986
[g@"That would be terrible," he said.

34
00:01:56.987 --> 00:02:00.422
"I'd better cough out Wukong."@g]

35
00:02:00.423 --> 00:02:02.968
The lion went to the middle of the room.

36
00:02:02.969 --> 00:02:08.981
He bent over and coughed. "Ahugh! Ahugh!"

37
00:02:08.982 --> 00:02:11.406
[g@Wukong laughed.

38
00:02:11.407 --> 00:02:15.244
"I'm still in here!"@g]

39
00:02:15.245 --> 00:02:20.130
"Ahugh! Ahugh!" The lion coughed again.

40
00:02:20.131 --> 00:02:24.663
But still Wukong stayed inside him.

41
00:02:24.664 --> 00:02:29.215
"I'm going to practice my fighting skills," announced the monkey.

42
00:02:29.216 --> 00:02:32.532
[g@[i@Boomph! Pow! Boomph! Pow!@i]

43
00:02:32.533 --> 00:02:36.317
Wukong punched and kicked inside the lion.@g]

44
00:02:36.318 --> 00:02:38.650
The lion fell to his knees.

45
00:02:38.651 --> 00:02:44.141
[g@"Ohh!" he moaned. "It hurts! It hurts!

46
00:02:44.142 --> 00:02:47.332
Wukong, please stop!"@g]

47
00:02:47.333 --> 00:02:50.510
"Let's make a deal," said Wukong.

48
00:02:50.511 --> 00:02:54.963
"I'll come out if you promise to let us cross the mountain safely."

49
00:02:54.964 --> 00:02:58.126
[g@The lion looked up at the raptor and the elephant.

50
00:02:58.127 --> 00:03:01.012
They both nodded.@g]

51
00:03:01.013 --> 00:03:05.299
"We promise." The lion moaned again.

52
00:03:05.300 --> 00:03:07.664
[g@"Okay then," said Wukong.

53
00:03:07.665 --> 00:03:10.193
"I'm coming out."@g]

54
00:03:10.194 --> 00:03:13.771
Wukong started the climb up the lion's throat.

55
00:03:13.772 --> 00:03:18.795
Just as he reached the lion's mouth, Wukong heard whispering.

56
00:03:18.796 --> 00:03:22.971
"Lion, I have a plan," whispered the elephant.

57
00:03:22.972 --> 00:03:27.245
"When Wukong tries to come out of your mouth, bite him."

58
00:03:27.246 --> 00:03:30.007
"I don't know . . . ," whispered the lion.

59
00:03:30.008 --> 00:03:32.128
[g@"Wukong is very strong.

60
00:03:32.129 --> 00:03:34.652
My belly still hurts."@g]

61
00:03:34.653 --> 00:03:39.252
"Chomp him quickly, before he can fight back," whispered the elephant.

62
00:03:39.253 --> 00:03:42.645
"Okay," said the lion.

63
00:03:42.646 --> 00:03:46.017
"Those dumb demons," thought Wukong.

64
00:03:46.018 --> 00:03:48.822
[g@"Don't they realize I can hear them?"

65
00:03:48.823 --> 00:03:51.378
He pulled out his iron bar.@g]

66
00:03:51.379 --> 00:03:54.906
"Shall I come out now?" asked the monkey.

67
00:03:54.907 --> 00:03:58.601
[g@"Um, yes," said the lion.

68
00:03:58.602 --> 00:04:02.018
Wukong heard the three demons snickering.@g]

69
00:04:02.019 --> 00:04:06.874
[g@"Okay," said Wukong. "I'm coming out."

70
00:04:06.875 --> 00:04:10.909
He held out the iron bar.@g]

71
00:04:10.910 --> 00:04:13.238
The lion bit down hard on the bar.

72
00:04:13.239 --> 00:04:19.227
[i@Crack!@i] A tooth shattered into tiny pieces.

73
00:04:19.228 --> 00:04:26.163
[g@"Ow! Ow! Ow!" the lion howled in pain.

74
00:04:26.164 --> 00:04:28.659
Tears streamed down his face.@g]

75
00:04:28.660 --> 00:04:33.733
He rolled around on the floor, holding his paws over his mouth.

76
00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:36.448
[g@"You villains!" Wukong shouted.

77
00:04:36.449 --> 00:04:39.086
"I heard you whispering!"@g]

78
00:04:39.087 --> 00:04:43.233
"I'm sorry." The lion was still crying.

79
00:04:43.234 --> 00:04:45.997
[g@"I won't try to bite you again.

80
00:04:45.998 --> 00:04:50.324
Please don't hurt me anymore."@g]

81
00:04:50.325 --> 00:04:52.248
[g@Wukong hesitated.

82
00:04:52.249 --> 00:04:54.384
"I'm coming out now.@g]

83
00:04:54.385 --> 00:04:58.186
You'd better not try any more tricks!"

84
00:04:58.187 --> 00:05:00.799
"We won't," said the elephant.

85
00:05:00.800 --> 00:05:04.236
"We promise," said the raptor.

86
00:05:04.237 --> 00:05:09.109
Wukong popped out of the lion's nose.

87
00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:17.495
He glared at the demons for a moment and then walked out of the cave.

88
00:05:17.496 --> 00:05:24.412
As soon as the monkey was gone, the elephant turned to the other two demons.

89
00:05:24.413 --> 00:05:31.750
"I have a new plan for capturing the Tang Monk."

